# Genshin Impact DPS Calculator & Optimizer Backend Formulas

This document outlines the complete algebraic frameworks required to build a functional Genshin Impact damage calculator and optimization engine, tracking everything from standard character scaling to modern advanced reaction mechanics.

---

## 1. The General Outgoing Damage Pipeline
Every standard talent-driven hit (Normal Attack, Skill, Burst) follows this global multiplicative pipeline:

$$Final\ DMG = \Big( Base\ DMG \times Base\ DMG\ Multiplier + Additive\ Base\ DMG\ Bonus \Big) \times \big(1 + DMG\ Bonus\big) \times CRIT \times DEF\ Mult \times RES\ Mult \times Amp\ Reaction$$

### A. Base DMG Layer
Calculated directly off the attacking character's talent percentages and current attribute scaling sheets:
$$Base\ DMG = Attribute_{Scale} \times Talent\ Multiplier\%$$

### B. The Bond of Life (BoL) Additive Base DMG Mechanics
Mechanics like Arlecchino's *Masque of the Red Death* or special weapon abilities operate as **Additive Base DMG Bonuses** (added directly into the flat talent bracket before critical/damage multipliers calculate):
$$Additive\ Base\ DMG\ Bonus = Total\ ATK \times \left( Masque\ Base\ Multiplier + C1\ Mask\ Modifier \right) \times \left(\frac{Current\ BoL\%}{100\%}\right)$$

* **The Decay Tracking Function:** Your engine must recalculate the current BoL volume step-by-step for every sequential strike:
  $$BoL_{Hit\ (n+1)} = BoL_{Hit\ n} - \Big(BoL_{Hit\ n} \times 0.075\Big)$$

### C. CRIT Bracket
* **On-Hit (Strict Boolean):** If critical hit occurs $\rightarrow (1 + CRIT\ DMG\%)$, else $\rightarrow 1$.
* **Statistical Expectation (Average DMG Optimization Curve):** Used exclusively by the optimizer search loop to evaluate total rotation DPS efficiency:
  $$CRIT_{Avg} = 1 + \left( CRIT\ Rate\% \times CRIT\ DMG\% \right)$$
  *(Note: Hard cap the internal calculation values for CRIT Rate at 1.00 and floor them at 0.05)*.

### D. Enemy DEF Multiplier
Determines exactly how much raw damage passes through based on character level, target enemy level, and defense reductions:
$$DEF\ Mult = \frac{Level_{Char} + 100}{(Level_{Char} + 100) + (Level_{Enemy} + 100) \times \big(1 - DEF\ Shred\%\big) \times \big(1 - DEF\ Ignore\%\big)}$$
*(Note: Ensure your logic limits total DEF Shred to a hard ceiling of 0.90)*.

### E. Enemy RES Multiplier
Evaluated non-linearly across three distinct conditions based on the enemy's final base resistance subtraction values ($Net\ RES = Enemy\ Base\ RES - RES\ Shreds$):
$$RES\ Mult = \begin{cases} 1 - \frac{Net\ RES}{2} & \text{if } Net\ RES < 0 \\  1 - Net\ RES & \text{if } 0 \le Net\ RES \le 0.75 \\  \frac{1}{4 \times Net\ RES + 1} & \text{if } Net\ RES > 0.75 \end{cases}$$

