## 3. Advanced Reaction Ecosystem: Lunar & Stellar Formulas
Unlike standard transformative formulas, Lunar and Stellar Glimmer reactions can CRIT, completely ignore enemy DEF scales, and map multi-character buff nodes.

### A. Global Lunar & Stellar Damage Core
$$Glimmer\ DMG = \Big(Reaction\ Base\ Value \times Jubilee/Moonsign\ Multiplier + Talent\ Additive\ Bonus\Big) \times \left(1 + \frac{16 \times EM}{2000 + EM}\right) \times CRIT \times Enemy\ RES\ Mult$$

### B. The Lunar Architecture (Hydro-Based Conversions)
Requires an active party node holding a **Moonsign Benediction** trait. Running two Moonsign units inside the calculation array shifts the party state from *Nascent Gleam* into *Ascendant Gleam*, adding a static global $+36\%$ Lunar DMG scaling bonus.
* **The Stat-to-Base Scaling Hook:** Specialized enablers inject flat base multiplier values into the equation:
  $$Jubilee/Moonsign\ Base\ Multiplier = 1 + \left( \frac{Support\ Attribute\ Value}{100} \times 0.007 \right) \quad (\text{Capped at a max of } 1.14)$$

### C. The Stellar Glimmer Architecture (Cryo-Based Conversions)
Gated explicitly behind a **Stellar Jubilee** passive node.
* **Stellar-Conduct (Cryo + Electro):** Creates a persistent *Polestar Field*. Tracks stacks over time to amplify subsequent active window base damage:
  $$Stellar\ Stacks_{New} = Cryo\ Hits + Electro\ Hits \quad (\text{Internal reset triggers every } 4.0\text{s loop})$$
